<title>USA: Lands' End Inc Q1 May 2 net rises.</title>
<headline>Lands' End Inc Q1 May 2 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>DODGEVILLE, Wis. 1997-05-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.35		    $0.13</p>
<p> Net			 11,306		    4,409</p>
<p> Revs		     244,720		  211,835</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  32,391		   33,631</p>
<p>(All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Current Q1 after $4,683,000 or $0.15 a share gain from sale of majority interest in The Territory Ahead. Excluding gain, current Q1 operating profit $6,623,000 or $0.20 a share vs $4,409,000 or $0.13 a share.</p>
<p>((Reuters Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
